    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051117.0096\n\nSINGAPORE, Nov. 17 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nSingapore shares end further higher\n\n\n\n\nThe shares prices in Singapore closed further higher on Thursday with the benchmark Strait Times Index (STI) rising 7 points to close at 2,261.5 points.\n\nThe overall volume stood at 654 million shares worth 697.9 million Singapore dollars (about 410.5 million US dollars).\n\nLosers led gainers by 252 to 235 with another 648 remained unchanged.\n\nOn Wednesday, the benchmark Strait Times Index rose 14 points to end at 2,254.5 points.",
